Third-party data and pictures used by Searchdrone
=================================================

Committed in this repository (see REUSE.toml for the licence of each file):

- simulation/gazebo/sites/*/osm.geojson: map layers (c) OpenStreetMap contributors,
  ODbL-1.0, https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright
- simulation/gazebo/sites/*/dem.asc: produced using Copernicus WorldDEM-30 (c) DLR e.V.
  2010-2014 and (c) Airbus Defence and Space GmbH 2014-2018 provided under COPERNICUS by
  the European Union and ESA; all rights reserved. The organisations in charge of the
  Copernicus programme by law or by delegation do not incur any liability for any use of
  the Copernicus WorldDEM-30.

Fetched by the tools into build/ and never committed. Simulator pictures made with them
(the nightly job's world snapshots) carry this attribution in their ATTRIBUTION.txt:

- tools/terrain/fetch_trees.py (just trees-fetch): tree positions and heights from
  Skogsstyrelsen's Trädhöjd (tree height raster, Laserdata skog), based on Laserdata
  Nedladdning, skog (c) Lantmäteriet, CC BY 4.0; processed. The tree list is not
  committed because the raster's own terms could not be confirmed: Skogsstyrelsen's
  general terms say CC0, the raster's map service says CC BY, and its download feed asks
  for registration and no redistribution.
- tools/terrain/fetch_trees.py: tree species from Nationella Marktäckedata 2023
  (NMD2023), källa: NMD, Naturvårdsverket, CC0.
- tools/terrain/fetch_tree_models.py (just tree-pictures-fetch): tree pictures made from
  Poly Haven's fir_tree_01, pine_tree_01, island_tree_02, pine_bark and bark_brown_02,
  CC0, https://polyhaven.com/license
- tools/terrain/fetch_site.py with [dem] source = "lantmateriet-mhm": Markhöjdmodell
  (c) Lantmäteriet, CC BY 4.0; processed. A public site that switches to it commits a
  dem.asc under CC BY 4.0: change its REUSE.toml annotation and this file with it.
- tools/terrain/fetch_site.py, local sites only: Lantmäteriet's orthophoto with the
  owner's own login, never committed or uploaded anywhere.
